A9_mirror: ∀ run -> DST end state == SRC end state, recursive (contents+structure+symlinks, stale deleted)
A2_oneway: sync host->workspace only
A5_fallback: cp/tar path converges to same end state as rsync --delete
A6_dryrun: ∀ mode=dry-run -> zero writes ∧ DST unmodified; A16: dry-run never creates DST
A3_units: systemd user units (Type=oneshot, OnUnitActiveSec=6h) ∧ standalone exec, no root
A19: refusal authority = closed list (A12, A14/A15, A18); refusals cite A-numbers; zero writes on refusal path
A17: SRC/DST env-parameterized; deployed values are production defaults
open: ∅ — all ambiguities resolved via A1..A20
